# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. The advance returns as soon as it starts,
# without waiting for acknowledgements or lease expiry.
MODULE: CompleteWriteEarly
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the write returns before every captured silo acknowledged or lapsed
PERTURBS: CompleteWrite

--- FIND
    /\ wstate = "advancing" /\ alive[wsilo]
    /\ \A t \in Silos : pend[t] \in {"no", "lapsed"}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the wait is skipped.
    /\ wstate = "advancing" /\ alive[wsilo]
    /\ TRUE
--- END
